<ptxt>Inspect Rear Combination Light Assembly LH</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Measure the voltage.</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Disconnect the connector.</ptxt>
</s3>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the voltage between each terminal of the vehicle side wire harness connector and body ground.</ptxt>
